bounds.\\\"},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/0/applications/0/bindings\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Instantiate with X=ℝⁿ, s=E, and d the NNReal coercion of the positive exponent below dim_H(E).\\\"},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/0/applications/1/bindings\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Instantiate with α=[0,1], β=ℕ, restricted Lebesgue measure, and f(i,t)=ρ_i^s times the indicator of J_i∩[0,1].\\\"},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/0/locals\\\",\\\"value\\\":[{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"D\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"ENNReal, dim_H(E)\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R001\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S003\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"definition\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Define D=dim_H(E).\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"E\\\",\\\"dim_H\\\"]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"F\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"subset ℝ^(n+1), E×[0,1]\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R001\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S003\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"definition\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Define F=E×[0,1].\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"E\\\",\\\"n\\\"]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"q\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"real exponent\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R001/S001\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"arbitrary\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Fix q>D.\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"D\\\"]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"δ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"positive scale\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R001\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S002\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"arbitrary\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Fix 0<δ≤1.\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"r_j\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"positive real sequence\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R001/S001\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"witness\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Choose positive cover diameters r_j≤δ with arbitrarily small q-